<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IMC said upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IMC said upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded IMC Global Inc to buy from neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 3/8 to 35-7/8 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
